        "PMC9026100::chunk::000::abstract::5d6ac9a02c"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective oxide tribolayer reduces friction by minimizing direct metal-to-metal contact.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7515071::chunk::000::abstract::cd6baea278"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coatings with higher grain-boundary density will form a thicker and more uniform protective tribolayer than coarser-grained baseline coatings.",
